Mega is a bit different – it doesn't use OAuth like Google does.

Authentication Method
Mega uses email and password for authentication :

javascript
// In your Firebase Cloud Function
const Mega = require('megajs');
const storage = new Mega.Storage({
    email: process.env.MEGA_EMAIL,
    password: process.env.MEGA_PASSWORD
});

// List files
const files = await storage.children();
Important Security Note
Store your Mega credentials as environment variables in Firebase Cloud Functions – never hardcode them!

